WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.035
- All right.

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.236
Settle, please.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.437
This is it, Bobby.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:04.971
All right.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:05.705
Here we go.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.573
Roll camera.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:07.607
- What am I doing?

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.943
- I'll do my thing,
and I'll go whoa.

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:10.877
You just react.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:11.578
- OK.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:12.112
- [shouts]

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:12.979
- Oh, whoa.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:13.780
- Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:14.681
- God.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.615
What the--

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.583
- You need your phone.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:17.617
- OK.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.818
- Phone's supposed
to be in your hand.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:19.753
Scare you?

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:20.587
- Yeah.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.121
Sorry about that.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.055
Let's do it.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:22.655
Here we go.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.356
- OK.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.124
- I'm going to vomit.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:24.991
Power things up.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:25.825
- Let's line it up.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:26.626
- Speeding.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.160
Rolling.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:27.994
Here we go.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:28.895
This is for real.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:29.863
Bobby will do the jump.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.131
And action.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.098
- [shouts]

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.266
- Whoa!

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:38.938
- Cut.

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:39.906
- Wow.

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:40.540
- [clapping]

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.474
- Whew.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.842
- Nice job.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:43.877
- Yeah, Bobby.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.911
- One take wonder, over here.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.379
- Yeah.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.614
- I'm glad they liked it.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.982
But that hurt.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:52.752
In training, I learned to keep
my chin down and body flat.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:57.624
But I didn't do that on
set, and I paid the price.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.525
- And now, I know.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.559
It ain't easy.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.227
But the successful
stunts are the ones

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.195
you can walk away from.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.096
- Appreciate that.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:04.664
Appreciate that.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.598
- Bobby, you good?

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:06.733
- Yeah.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.768
The fall was the thing
I was most afraid of.

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.069
- All right.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.305
Now, down to your final
F. And that is fire.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:13.440
- All right, Bobby.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.841
In position.

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:18.044
- But the burn is the thing that
I think is the most dangerous.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:21.781
- I have a Molotov cocktail
that I will drop into position.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:23.983
And that will ignite your arm.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.318
Are you ready?

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.053
- Is anyone really ready
to ever be set on fire?

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.154
- [laughs]

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.088
- All right.

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:29.923
We all set?

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:30.657
Johnny, you ready?

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.090
- Yes, sir.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:31.925
- OK.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.059
Light the Molotov.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:33.827
- You need this
right here, right?

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.228
- Here we go.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.963
- Everything in my mind
is saying, this is insane.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.233
[bottle shatters]

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:43.603
- [yells]

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.537
- Calm down.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.138
There you go.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:45.972
Give me his face.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:46.606
- Wave it.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.040
Wave it.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:47.907
Good.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:48.608
Go back to the fire.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:53.213
- [yells]

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.113
- Are you OK?

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.448
- Yeah.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.784
The hardest part about
that is letting it burn

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:59.385
and not reacting to it.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.487
- You did a good job.

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:00.954
- Thank you.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.821
I feel good.

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:02.622
- All right, Bobby.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.791
Just one more.

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:05.725
I'm kidding.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.426
That was great.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:07.060
We got it.

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:07.894
We totally got it.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:08.862
- Oh, my goodness.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:09.896
- [laughs] Nice job, man.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:10.630
You really did good job.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.464
- Thank you.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:12.732
I was pretty proud of myself.

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.335
I felt like I handled
that pretty well.

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:18.438
[music]

